OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers at first this
OL,6,Fmorning. Otherwise mainly dry with
OL,7,Fsome bright or sunny spells although
OL,8,Fturning rather cloudy during the
OL,9,Fmorning. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FChance of a little light rain
OL,12,Ffor a time this evening. Otherwise
OL,13,Fvariable amounts of cloud overnight
OL,14,Fwith the odd shower, these mainly
OL,15,Facross the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA mainly dry and cloudy day.
OL,18,FSome showery rain likely to spread
OL,19,Feast later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
